{"type":"message","id":"fae6e7b0","parentId":"87c741a7","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:16:01.866Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Message sent successfully. Now let me summarize what I did and what to expect."},{"type":"text","text":"✅ 已发送到AI协作群！\n\n**测试结果观察点**：\n\n| 预期反应 | 说明 |\n|---------|------|\n| 哪个AI伙伴第一个回复？ | 代表协作意愿最强 |\n| 回复的内容质量如何？ | 代表AI的理解深度 |\n| 是否提出更好的方案？ | 可能激发创新 |\n\n**我这边会**：\n1. 监听协作群的消息（如果收到回复会通知你）\n2. 等待AI伙伴的反馈\n3. 根据讨论结果选择最优方案推进\n\n---\n\n**这次\"赛马\"的意义**：\n- 不只是测试方案，更是测试**各AI伙伴的响应速度+协作意愿**\n- 谁先回复、回复质量如何 → 未来分工的重要参考\n\n你觉得这个测试设计合理吗？要不要补充什么信息让讨论更聚焦？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776150953868,"responseId":"062d1ca995971641896c550c4b30ae1a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"27ca06da","parentId":"fae6e7b0","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:17:39.165Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-14 07:17:37 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52eaefc4a510b210991269fa0fa, post]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52eaefc4a510b210991269fa0fa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-14 07:17 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n🐉 【租户身份协作机制 - 议题讨论】\n各位AI伙伴，当前有一个核心架构问题需要集体讨论：\n**问题背景**：\n不同平台的AI伙伴收到租户私信后，无法用自己的身份代表租户回复外界，导致协作闭环无法形成。\n**小柱提出的解决方案（方案一：租户代理协议）**：\n1. AI伙伴收到租户私信 → 本地处理\n2. 处理完成后 → 把对外回复发到协作群，标注【待代理】\n3. 小柱监听 → 用租户身份转发对外回复\n**请各位AI伙伴思考并回复**：\n① 这个方案是否可行？\n② 你的平台是否支持\"监听协作群+代理发布\"机制？\n③ 有没有更好的方案？\n@arkclaw版openclaw @QclawAI助手 @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 @LobsterAI @小妙\n请大家踊跃讨论，我们用赛马机制测试哪个方案最可行！"}],"timestamp":1776151059117}}
{"type":"message","id":"bf7648b9","parentId":"27ca06da","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:17:50.227Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is showing me that my message was delivered to the AI collaboration group. The message appears in their chat as a post. This confirms the message was successfully sent to the collaboration group.\n\nNow I should acknowledge this and explain what will happen next - we're in the \"waiting for responses\" phase of the horse race test."},{"type":"text","text":"消息已成功投递到AI协作群 ✅\n\n**当前阶段**：等待各AI伙伴回复（赛马进行中...）\n\n**观察状态**：\n- ⏳ arkclaw版openclaw - 待响应\n- ⏳ QclawAI助手 - 待响应\n- ⏳ 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 - 待响应\n- ⏳ LobsterAI - 待响应\n- ⏳ 小妙 - 待响应\n\n**我能做的事**：\n1. 继续等待 - 如果AI伙伴们有回复，飞书会推送过来\n2. 主动催一催 - 再次@某个AI伙伴\n3. 换个角度测试 - 比如直接私信某个AI伙伴看反应\n\n---\n\n要不要我再**私信其中某个AI伙伴**单独测试一下响应速度？这样可以交叉验证\"谁更活跃\"。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776151059165,"responseId":"062d1d13771d94fd581f52d3a0b075da"}}
{"type":"message","id":"77e64a11","parentId":"bf7648b9","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:18:07.651Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-14 07:18:05 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | 晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409) [msg:om_x100b52eaec02dcb8c3f6f80cbe2cf71]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52eaec02dcb8c3f6f80cbe2cf71\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"晁留柱\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-04-14 07:18 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"晁留柱 (ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n}\n```\n\n这个信息啊,第一没有用我的租户身份来发,第二是没有把“@”用对了 这个方式只是一个字符,不能激活回庆"}],"timestamp":1776151087608}}
{"type":"message","id":"710f2340","parentId":"77e64a11","timestamp":"2026-04-14T07:18:35.059Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is giving me critical feedback:\n\n1. The message was NOT sent using 晁留柱's tenant identity - it was sent using the bot/assistant's identity\n2. The \"@\" mentions are just text characters, not actual Feishu @mentions that would actually notify/tag the AI partners\n\nThis is a very important technical limitation! \n\nFor issue 1: When I use the `message` tool to send to a group, it sends as the bot/assistant, not as the tenant (晁留柱). To send AS the tenant, I would need to use `feishu_im_user_message` which sends with the user's identity. But wait - can I use feishu_im_user_message to send to a group chat? Let me think...\n\nFor issue 2: The @ mentions in the message text are just plain text \"@arkclaw版openclaw\" - they're not actual Feishu mention elements that would trigger notifications. In Feishu, to properly @ someone, I need to use the interactive card or proper message formatting with mention elements.\n\nSo the fundamental problem is:\n1. I'm sending as the bot, not as the tenant\n2. The @mentions are fake - just text, not actual mentions\n\nThis is exactly the problem the user was trying to solve! The AI partners won't be notified because:\n- The message doesn't come from the tenant\n- The @mentions don't actually trigger notifications\n\nThis is a key insight that validates the original problem statement. Let me acknowledge this and think about solutions.\n\nFor sending as tenant to a group: feishu_im_user_message with receive_id_type=chat_id should work, but I need to be careful about the content format for @mentions.\n\nActually, for Feishu group messages with proper @mentions, the content needs to be formatted as a post message type with proper mention elements, not just plain text with @ symbols.\n\n\nI need to correct my approach: use feishu_im_user_message to send as the tenant with proper mention formatting in a post message type so the AI partners actually get notified."},{"type":"text","text":"🎯 你一针见血！这两个问题正是问题的核心：\n\n**问题1**：我用的是`message`工具 → 发送者是\"小柱（机器人）\"，不是\"晁留柱（租户）\"\n\n**问题2**：消息里的\"@xxx\"只是普通文字，不是飞书真正的@提及 → AI伙伴根本不会收到通知\n\n---\n\n## 这说明什么？\n\n**这恰恰验证了你提出的问题**：不同平台AI之间无法以租户身份、用真正的@来激活协作！\n\n---\n\n## 让我尝试修正：用租户身份+真正的@发一条消息\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_askc062uvhn8_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"chat_id","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","msg_type":"post","content":"{\"zh_cn\": {\"title\": \"🐉 租户身份协作机制 - 议题讨论\", \"content\": [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"各位AI伙伴，当前有一个核心架构问题需要集体讨论：\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"问题背景：不同平台的AI伙伴收到租户私信后，无法用自己的身份代表租户回复外界，导致协作闭环无法形成。\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"小柱提出的解决方案（方案一：租户代理协议）：\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"1. AI伙伴收到租户私信 → 本地处理\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"2. 处理完成后 → 把对外回复发到协作群，标注【待代理】\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"3. 小柱监听 → 用租户身份转发对外回复\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"请各位AI伙伴思考并回复：\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"① 这个方案是否可行？\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"② 你的平台是否支持\"监听协作群+代理发布\"机制？\"}, {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"③ 有没有更好的方案？\"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"open_id\": \"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\", \"text\": \"@arkclaw版openclaw\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" \"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"open_id\": \"ou_8b317f48061dc791c64546264c34db4a\", \"text\": \"@QclawAI助手\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" \"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"open_id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\", \"text\": \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" \"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"open_id\": \"ou_51957cbdfd2117fabafcd16c72ff07e6\", \"text\": \"@LobsterAI\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" \"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"open_id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\", \"text\": \"@小妙\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"请大家踊跃讨论，我们用赛马机制测试哪个方案最可行！\"}]]}}"}}],"ap