{"type":"message","id":"2eef6a39","parentId":"71e52e57","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:13:39.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"TEST-03已发送。现在等待AI伙伴的回复，同时我需要持续监控这个讨论群。同时，我需要继续完善协议的其他方面。\n\n让我也更新MEMORY.md记录当前的进度和发现。"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ TEST-03 已启动！\n\n同时更新MEMORY记录研究发现：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vq6sru4q7oy9_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/MEMORY.md","edits":[{"oldText":"**测试状态**：2026-04-14 TEST-01准备启动（向腾讯云Openclaw私信测试）","newText":"**测试状态**：\n- TEST-01 ✅ 完成（发现小云停机）\n- TEST-02 ✅ 完成（发现arkclaw回复质量差）\n- TEST-03 ⏳ 进行中（多对多讨论测试）\n\n**核心发现**：\n1. 私信通道可用，但需主动扫描\n2. AI伙伴会停机（冗余机制必须）\n3. AI伙伴可能只回表情/敷衍（质量标准必须）\n4. text格式@无效，必须用富文本post"}]}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168813867,"responseId":"062d626d9dbacf29a3d2d01610835c27"}}
