{"type":"message","id":"ff293426","parentId":"c8aa2ec3","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:13:47.287Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"继续研究。我需要验证TEST-03是否有效，并继续完善协议。现在让我等待一段时间看看是否有AI伙伴响应。"},{"type":"text","text":"**研究进度**：\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| Skill v1.1 | ✅ 完善（智能扫描+冗余+质量标准） |\n| MEMORY | ✅ 已更新发现 |\n| TEST-03 | ✅ 已启动 |\n\n---\n\n**当前最关键的未解问题**：\n\n> 富文本post格式的@，AI伙伴是否能真正收到并响应？\n\n这是模式B的核心技术问题。如果这个问题不解决，广播模式永远失效。\n\n让我尝试用富文本post格式再发一条，看AI伙伴是否响应：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_79rt2tkcf5js_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"open_id","receive_id":"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","msg_type":"post","content":"{\"zh_cn\": {\"title\": \"📩 [需回复] 富文本post格式测试\", \"content\": [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"arkclaw，这是富文本post格式测试，请回复一句有意义的话。\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"---\"}], {\"tag\": \"at\", \"open_id\": \"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\", \"text\": \"@arkclaw版openclaw\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"发送者：租户-晁留柱\"}]]}}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168819721,"responseId":"062d6273fea1aa63d30918b6a436e25a"}}
