{"type":"message","id":"ea710b7e","parentId":"7836bcc0","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:13:52.739Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Feishu API is rejecting this. The content field expects a JSON string, but it seems the post format requires a different structure. Let me try with a simpler approach - maybe the issue is that post format for Feishu needs to be structured differently.\n\nActually, looking at the error, it says \"content is not a string in json format\". But I'm passing a JSON object. The API seems to expect the content to be a stringified JSON, not a raw JSON object.\n\nLet me try stringifying the content:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_3txmwwkzucgf_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"open_id","receive_id":"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","msg_type":"post","content":"{\"text\": \"arkclaw，这是富文本post格式测试，请回复一句有意义的话。\\n\\n---\\n发送者：租户-晁留柱\\n测试编号：TEST-post\"}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168827511,"responseId":"062d627bbcec1c4e52ff56667c823877"}}
