{"type":"message","id":"c82b4693","parentId":"3471fff9","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:13:58.776Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The post format is failing. Let me check what the correct format should be. Looking at the skill, post type needs a specific JSON structure. Let me try with the proper structure from the skill examples.\n\nLooking at the feishu_im_user_message docs: post type content should be in a specific format with \"zh_cn\" for Chinese content.\n\nLet me try with the correct format - it needs to be a stringified JSON object in the content field."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l6j2gqogbhgd_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat << 'EOF' > /tmp/post_test.json\n{\n  \"zh_cn\": {\n    \"title\": \"📩 [需回复] 富文本post格式测试\",\n    \"content\": [\n      [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"arkclaw，这是富文本post格式测试，请回复一句有意义的话。\"}],\n      [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"---\"}],\n      [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"open_id\": \"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\", \"text\": \"@arkclaw版openclaw\"}],\n      [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"发送者：租户-晁留柱\"}]\n    ]\n  }\n}\nEOF\ncat /tmp/post_test.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168833020,"responseId":"062d628112e235ef780813b3669cbdeb"}}
