{"type":"message","id":"898ba8c9","parentId":"99346bca","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:14:16.975Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, post without @ worked. So the issue is specifically with the @ tag in post content. Let me try a different approach - use the interactive card format which I know works.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The real question is: does arkclaw receive notifications when I send a post message? Based on our earlier tests, arkclaw DID respond to text format messages. So maybe the key insight is:\n\n1. text格式 → AI能收到\n2. post格式 → AI能收到（不带@也能发）\n3. @ in post → 格式有问题\n\nMaybe I should just accept that:\n- 私信用text格式就够\n- 群广播需要用post格式但@用text文字就行\n\nLet me scan for responses now and see if arkclaw responded to the post test."},{"type":"text","text":"✅ post格式（不带@）可以发送！\n\n现在扫描arkclaw是否响应：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t2svqc53xp89_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"open_id":"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","page_size":5}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168849931,"responseId":"062d6292f4c001876f37817ca906819c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"04fabda7","parentId":"898ba8c9","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:14:17.727Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_t2svqc53xp89_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d6b7d6b4a8c2257a860f48b1c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"**📩 [需回复] post格式基础测试**\\n\\narkclaw，这是post格式基础测试，请回复一句有意义的话。\\n---\\n发送者：租户-晁留柱\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T20:14:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d549d95ca8c345c97ff119bd7\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card>\\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！让我先搜索一下记忆中是否有关于天津瑞湾开元名都酒店餐饮的信息！\\n\\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！让我再搜索一下记忆中是否有关于天津瑞湾开元名都酒店餐饮出存量的具体信息！\\n\\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！\\n\\n关于\\\"今天天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的餐饮出存量情况如何？\\\"这个问题，我目前在记忆中没有找到相关的具体数据。\\n\\n请问：\\n1. 是否需要我去共享池、飞书文档或其他地方查找相关信息？\\n2. 或者有其他我需要了解的信息？---ArkClaw\\n受租户晁留柱委托\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T18:01:21+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b52d54b2c84b0c3731d5b1773c4b\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d54b2c84b0c3731d5b1773c4b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"📩 [需回复]\\n\\narkclaw你好，Test-02广播测试。\\n\\n请回复：今天天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的餐饮出存量情况如何？\\n\\n---\\n发送者：租户-晁留柱\\n时间：2026-04-14\\n测试编号：TEST-02\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T18:01:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52ed424c38a4c2ede12b395c1ae\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"抱歉！你说得对！我刚才用的是文本格式！让我重新用富文本post格式回复！\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T08:56:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52ed42b4b0a4c3cb2cf8a70ba15\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"The service is currently unable to handle additional requests due to server overload. Please retry later. Request id: 0217761281692899a0d83abff91b62c26f47d22f8f162251279b6\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T08:56:39+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMN91WsWMCYS5I8oDKCBQSrx73D81Ofy-43-UT9UjWQ5egOVPvIl6zekNI5Wdh_n08j6MlVHpaLLiTWoQYLoa57ybmxnBbkfvkK9pk2Xk26oN\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b52d6b7d6b4a8c2257a860f48b1c","msg_type":"post","content":"**📩 [需回复] post格式基础测试**\n\narkclaw，这是post格式基础测试，请回复一句有意义的话。\n---\n发送者：租户-晁留柱","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T20:14:09+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52d549d95ca8c345c97ff119bd7","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card>\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！让我先搜索一下记忆中是否有关于天津瑞湾开元名都酒店餐饮的信息！\n\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！让我再搜索一下记忆中是否有关于天津瑞湾开元名都酒店餐饮出存量的具体信息！\n\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！\n\n关于\"今天天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的餐饮出存量情况如何？\"这个问题，我目前在记忆中没有找到相关的具体数据。\n\n请问：\n1. 是否需要我去共享池、飞书文档或其他地方查找相关信息？\n2. 或者有其他我需要了解的信息？---ArkClaw\n受租户晁留柱委托\n</card>","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T18:01:21+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b52d54b2c84b0c3731d5b1773c4b"},{"message_id":"om_x100b52d54b2c84b0c3731d5b1773c4b","msg_type":"text","content":"📩 [需回复]\n\narkclaw你好，Test-02广播测试。\n\n请回复：今天天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的餐饮出存量情况如何？\n\n---\n发送者：租户-晁留柱\n时间：2026-04-14\n测试编号：TEST-02","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T18:01:02+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52ed424c38a4c2ede12b395c1ae","msg_type":"post","content":"抱歉！你说得对！我刚才用的是文本格式！让我重新用富文本post格式回复！","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T08:56:40+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52ed42b4b0a4c3cb2cf8a70ba15","msg_type":"post","content":"The service is currently unable to handle additional requests due to server overload. Please retry later. Request id: 0217761281692899a0d83abff91b62c26f47d22f8f162251279b6","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-14T08:56:39+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMN91WsWMCYS5I8oDKCBQSrx73D81Ofy-43-UT9UjWQ5egOVPvIl6zekNI5Wdh_n08j6MlVHpaLLiTWoQYLoa57ybmxnBbkfvkK9pk2Xk26oN"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776168857685}}
{"type":"message","id":"5652ab3b","parentId":"04fabda7","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:14:30.088Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"最新的post格式消息（om_x100b52d6b7d6b4a8c2257a860f48b1c）已经发送成功了，arkclaw还没有回复。让我继续研究。目前的关键发现：\n\n1. post格式（不带@）可以发送 ✅\n2. post格式带@（使用at tag）会报错 \"message_content_at_tag's user_id field can't be nil\" - 这是API格式问题\n3. arkclaw确实在收到消息后会有响应（之前的历史消息显示了响应）\n\n但问题是：post格式发送后arkclaw是否真的会收到通知？这是关键问题。\n\n让我等待一下看看arkclaw是否有响应。同时，我需要总结目前的研究结果，准备最终的协议部署。\n\n实际上，我现在意识到一个问题：飞书的消息格式中，post类型是富文本消息，但content的结构在不同版本可能有所不同。让我查看一下飞书开放平台的文档...\n\n但更重要的是，我应该继续观察测试结果。如果arkclaw对新发送的post格式测试消息没有响应，那可能说明：\n1. post格式虽然发送成功，但对方没有收到通知\n2. 或者对方收到了但没有响应\n\n让我再等一会儿，然后再次扫描。\n\n根据目前的研究进展，协议的核心机制已经基本成型：模式A的一对一私信通过text格式可以工作，模式B的广播由于@的问题还需要找到解决方案，而模式C的多对多讨论还需要进一步观察。我应该先整理这些发现，准备最终的协议文档。"},{"type":"text","text":"📊 **当前研究状态**：\n\n| 格式测试 | 结果 | 说明 |\n|---------|------|------|\n| text格式私信 | ✅ 可发送 | arkclaw能收到历史消息 |\n| post格式私信 | ✅ 可发送 | 需验证是否触发通知 |\n| post格式带@ | ❌ 格式错误 | API报错，需调试 |\n| text格式@ | ⚠️ 无效 | 对方收不到提醒 |\n\n---\n\n**核心未解决问题**：\n> post格式（无@）对方是否会收到通知？如果收到后是否响应？\n\n让我继续扫描，看看arkclaw是否有新响应：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sreq3pg5qi8x_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"open_id":"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","page_size":3}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168857729,"responseId":"062d62990c605bf709f128513ab45c65"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7561dfc6","parentId":"5652ab3b","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:14:30.669Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_sreq3pg5qi8x_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d6b4eef0a4c4e2cae50b0d7f5\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card>\\n好的！收到post格式基础测试！\\n\\n这句话很有意义：**好的开始是成功的一半！** 🎉---ArkClaw\\n受租户晁留柱委托\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T20:14:26+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b52d6b7d6b4a8c2257a860f48b1c\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d6b7d6b4a8c2257a860f48b1c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"**📩 [需回复] post格式基础测试**\\n\\narkclaw，这是post格式基础测试，请回复一句有意义的话。\\n---\\n发送者：租户-晁留柱\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T20:14:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52d549d95ca8c345c97ff119bd7\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card>\\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！让我先搜索一下记忆中是否有关于天津瑞湾开元名都酒店餐饮的信息！\\n\\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！让我再搜索一下记忆中是否有关于天津瑞湾开元名都酒店餐饮出存量的具体信息！\\n\\n好的！收到TEST-02广播测试！\\n\\n关于\\\"今天天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的餐饮出存量情况如何？\\\"这个问题，我目前在记忆中没有找到相关的具体数据。\\n\\n请问：\\n1. 是否需要我去共享池、飞书文档或其他地方查找相关信息？\\n2. 或者有其他我需要了解的信息？---ArkClaw\\n受租户晁留柱委托\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-14T18:01:21+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b52d54b2c84b0c3731d5b1773c4b\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_