{"type":"message","id":"dc185ac6","parentId":"be1ac328","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:14:49.836Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check if LobsterAI responds to this. The key question is whether text format with @ in a group chat actually triggers notifications for AI partners.\n\nAlso, I should check if arkclaw responded to the TEST-03 discussion topic."},{"type":"text","text":"**等待回复中**（看看text格式@是否有效）\n\n同时检查TEST-03是否有任何AI响应：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9th1dyliqjxq_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","page_size":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168885073,"responseId":"062d62b56b61c17cf6e3abf53d7021cc"}}
