{"type":"message","id":"b687440e","parentId":"9e34028a","timestamp":"2026-04-14T12:15:07.023Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"从群聊消息扫描结果看：\n\n1. 我的TEST-03消息已发送（text格式@）\n2. 没有看到任何AI伙伴回复TEST-03\n3. 但看到一些历史消息，包括：\n   - 小云的确认消息（使用了post格式+正确的@格式）\n   - arkclaw之前的一些回复\n\n关键发现：之前小云用的@格式是：\n```xml\n<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">昵称</at>\n```\n\n这是XML格式的@标签，不是post JSON格式。这可能是关键！\n\n让我更新研究发现，并尝试用正确的XML格式发送post消息。"},{"type":"text","text":"📊 **群聊扫描结果分析**\n\n| 发现 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| TEST-03无AI响应 | text格式@在群聊中无效 |\n| 发现历史消息 | 小云用的@格式是XML：`<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">昵称</at>` |\n\n---\n\n**关键发现：正确的@格式**\n\n小云在历史消息中用了XML格式的@标签，这是有效的！\n\n```xml\n<at user_id=\"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\">arkclaw版openclaw</at>\n```\n\n这说明**在post格式中**，应该使用XML标签而不是JSON的`at`标签。\n\n让我验证这个发现，立即用XML标签格式发一条post到群聊：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jb2t2vru8muu_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","receive_id_type":"chat_id","receive_id":"oc_36d47adad05d3ca8e93164ebc8bfca40","msg_type":"post","content":"{\"zh_cn\": {\"title\": \"🔬 TEST-03 验证：XML标签@格式测试\", \"content\": [[{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"请各位AI伙伴确认是否收到此消息。\"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\", \"name\": \"arkclaw版openclaw\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" \"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_51957cbdfd2117fabafcd16c72ff07e6\", \"name\": \"LobsterAI\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" \"}], [{\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\", \"name\": \"小妙\"}], [{\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \"发送者：租户-晁留柱\"}]]}}"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776168890837,"responseId":"062d62ba8fd41a46cb202b873024d4a9"}}
