 OpenClaw Skills: Complete Guide to Skill Sources\",\n      \"url\": \"https://dev.to/andrew-ooo/where-to-find-openclaw-skills-complete-guide-to-skill-sources-100h\",\n      \"description\": \"Andrew\\nPosted on Feb 16\\nWhere to Find OpenClaw Skills: Complete Guide to Skill Sources\\n# agents\\n# ai\\n# opensource\\n# tutorial\\nOriginally published on andrew.ooo\\nTL;DR: OpenClaw skills come from 5 main sources: ClawHub (official marketplace), BankrBot (crypto/DeFi), skills.sh (cross-agent directory), GitHub repositories, and bundled skills. Install with <beginning of the code>cl...\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenClaw\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.z.ai/devpack/tool/openclaw\",\n      \"description\": \"Prerequisites:\\nNode.js 22 or newer\\nInstall via npm:\\n<beginning of the code>\\nnpm install -g openclaw@latest\\n<end of the code>\\nOr via pnpm (recommended):\\n<beginning of the code>\\n...\\nAfter running the installation commands above, the configuration process will start automatically. If it doesn’t start, you can run the following command to begin configuration:\\nopenclaw onboard --install-daemon\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"skill-clawhub\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/LvcidPsyche/skill-clawhub\",\n      \"description\": \"clawhub login\\nclawhub whoami\\nSearch for Skills\\nclawhub search \\\"postgres backups\\\"\\nInstall Skills\\n# Install latest version\\nclawhub install my-skill\\n\\n# Install specific version\\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\\nUpdate Skills\\n# Update a specific skill\\nclawhub update my-skill\\n\\n# Update to specific version\\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\\n\\n\",\n      \"siteName\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"🦞 Awesome OpenClaw Skills\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/sjkncs/awesome-openclaw-skills/blob/master/README_CN.md\",\n      \"description\": \"Files\\nExpand file tree\\nmaster\\nBreadcrumbs\