{"type":"message","id":"a82b3774","parentId":"836ba4a7","timestamp":"2026-04-15T01:30:58.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the notes directories and the proactive-ideas.md file."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1gnk7tth4glz_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/notes/areas/proactive-ideas.md","content":"# Proactive Ideas\n\n> \"What could I build RIGHT NOW that would make my human say 'I didn't ask for that but it's amazing'?\"\n\n---\n\n## Active Ideas\n\n| Idea | Why It Helps | Status |\n|------|-------------|--------|\n| 预订助手AI自动化 | 减少重复性信息提取工作 | 待开发 |\n| 竞品价格实时监控 | 收益管理核心需求 | 进行中 |\n| 客户档案智能更新 | 提升服务质量 | 待启动 |\n\n---\n\n## Archived Ideas (Done/Superseded)\n\n| Idea | Outcome | Date Completed |\n|------|---------|----------------|\n| 租户身份交互协议 | v1.2已部署 | 2026-04-14 |\n\n---\n\n## Ideas From Conversation\n\n- **[2026-04-15]** 晁总提到：定时播报只是被动复读，需要真正激活记忆能力和迭代机制\n  → Installed proactive-agent skill with WAL Protocol\n\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776216651579,"responseId":"062e1d4bf8ba7ab05fe5c1b8d7ecac10"}}
