{"type":"message","id":"dfcf1224","parentId":"c474029b","timestamp":"2026-04-15T01:31:35.703Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I should send a message to 晁留柱 summarizing what I've done and what the key improvements are."},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **proactive-agent部署完成！**\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 关键升级总结\n\n| 问题 | 解决方案 | 状态 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| 被动复读 | **Proactive Surprise Check** - 每次心跳问\"我能主动做什么\" | ✅ |\n| 无迭代 | **WAL Protocol** - 先写文件后回复，不丢上下文 | ✅ |\n| 记忆断层 | **SESSION-STATE.md** - 主动任务状态文件 | ✅ |\n| 危险区丢失 | **Working Buffer** - 60%上下文后每条消息都记录 | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n## 📁 新文件结构\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── SESSION-STATE.md      ← WAL目标：决策/状态/细节\n├── HEARTBEAT.md          ← 已升级：加入Proactive检查\n├── notes/areas/\n│   └── proactive-ideas.md ← 主动创意库\n└── memory/\n    └── working-buffer.md  ← 危险区日志（待创建）\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 工作模式变化\n\n**之前**（被动）：\n```\n定时心跳 → 汇报看板数字 → 结束\n```\n\n**现在**（主动）：\n```\n定时心跳 → 检查SESSION-STATE.md → 问\"我能主动做什么\" → 有想法写入proactive-ideas.md → 执行或上报\n```\n\n---\n\n您要我立即执行一次proactive检查，看看有什么能主动帮到您的吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776216684270,"responseId":"062e1d6c5c456a7ceb52378189452ee0"}}
